    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2381710/extras/425028e7c299b5cd18e5316457681cb7.avif?t=1748222563\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Agent Red has one job, to hide the existence of aliens. But when a UFO shows up and starts dropping their food everywhere, things start to get a little troublesome. The fastest way to get rid of all the food? Eating it, obviously. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cute girl who gains weight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An endless desert to drive in.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gallery and achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Censored and uncensored options.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HOW TO PLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive through an endless desert while dodging obstacles and eating food. If you get hurt 3 times, it's game over. Try to survive as long as you can and gather as much food as you can eat along the way.</p>",
